1
00:00:00,146 --> 00:00:01,946
(whooping, clapping)

2
00:00:01,947 --> 00:00:03,277
(Leonard:)Speech! Speech!

3
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:06,150
(Raj:)Come on, Sheldon,
say something.

4
00:00:06,152 --> 00:00:07,382
(Sheldon:)Uh, um...

5
00:00:07,386 --> 00:00:09,886
(Sheldon:)uh, thank you all
so much for coming.

6
00:00:09,889 --> 00:00:11,119
Uh, Beverly.

7
00:00:11,123 --> 00:00:13,123
(Sheldon:)Wil Wheaton.

8
00:00:13,125 --> 00:00:15,625
(Leonard:)Adam West,
for some reason.

9
00:00:16,996 --> 00:00:19,766
(Leonard:)Batman finally came
to your party.

10
00:00:19,765 --> 00:00:22,495
(Adam:)Happy birthday, Sherman.

11
00:00:25,671 --> 00:00:27,101
SHELDON:
Thank you.

12
00:00:27,106 --> 00:00:28,976
(Sheldon:)This is all so thoughtful.

13
00:00:28,974 --> 00:00:31,914
(heartbeat thumping loudly)

14
00:00:37,616 --> 00:00:39,446
(panting):
Excuse me.

15
00:00:46,792 --> 00:00:48,662
(Adam:)I still get paid, don't I?

16
00:00:55,959 --> 00:00:58,429
(Leonard:)Okay, I'd better go in
there and talk to him.

17
00:00:58,428 --> 00:01:00,398
(Amy:)Well, don't you think
I'm the one who should go in?

